    "text": "kotatv.com\nwebsite\nRapid City\nIconic Budweiser Clydesdales stand out 85th Sturgis Motorcycle Rally\nBy Bryan Savic,\n8 hours agoRAPID CITY, S.D. (KOTA) - You’ve seen them gallop in plenty of Budweiser Super Bowl commercials, now rally-goers will have a chance to see them up-close, in person. The Budweiser Clydesdale horses will appear at the Sturgis Motorcycle Rally’s opening ceremonies on Friday and will trot out again for Military Appreciation Day on Aug. 5.\n3",
